    {
      "id": "6rFPgCcdx34vxQ7_MdmWv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2021.2698432128968,
      "y": 18479.336338814286,
      "width": 585.4885097672295,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1323649378,
      "version": 203,
      "versionNonce": 906471486,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742403705767,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non functional requirements:\n1. Highly available\n2. Eventual consistency\n3. Scalable - concurrent users\n4. Fault tolerant",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non functional requirements:\n1. Highly available\n2. Eventual consistency\n3. Scalable - concurrent users\n4. Fault tolerant",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A4oV3YCCW-hiU3y13tfcG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3707.895046193433,
      "y": 17845.209139242794,
      "width": 684.2925921490587,
      "height": 945,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGo",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 466267362,
      "version": 382,
      "versionNonce": 1326304574,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742403078078,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Back of the envelope calculation\n\n1. 10M DAU - \nReads -> 10 * 10M -> 100M / 86400 -\n> 1000 rps * 5\n> 5k rps\n\nWrites -> \n1 or 2 video per day\n\n\n2. Storage\n\n2 * 10000 -> 20k hours\n10 * 1000  -> 2k hours\n\n-> 25k hours\n2 hour -> 2GB * 5 -> 10GB\n\n10 GB * 25000 -> 250TB\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Back of the envelope calculation\n\n1. 10M DAU - \nReads -> 10 * 10M -> 100M / 86400 -> 1000 rps * 5\n> 5k rps\n\nWrites -> \n1 or 2 video per day\n\n\n2. Storage\n\n2 * 10000 -> 20k hours\n10 * 1000  -> 2k hours\n\n-> 25k hours\n2 hour -> 2GB * 5 -> 10GB\n\n10 GB * 25000 -> 250TB\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zhFmog_fvTz8wnVh-7IDI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1979.6401549592197,
      "y": 18921.135408947037,
      "width": 647.7767839108983,
      "height": 1125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 615300450,
      "version": 551,
      "versionNonce": 1230701438,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742403898443,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LOw Level Design -> DB Schema\n\n\n1. VideoMetadata\nPK -> videoId: UUID\nSK -> \n\"FORMAT#MP4#240p\"\n\"CHUNK#MP4#480P#1\"\n\nlength: number\ncategoryId: UUID\ncontentType: ContentType (MOVIE,\nSERIES, PODCAST)\n\ntype: VideoMetadataType (CHUNK,\nFORMAT, VIDEO)\nfileUrl: string\nstatus: VideoStatus\n(IN_PROGRESS, COMPLETED,\nDELETED)\ntitle: string\n\ncreatedAt: timestamp\nupdatedAt: timestamp\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LOw Level Design -> DB Schema\n\n\n1. VideoMetadata\nPK -> videoId: UUID\nSK -> \n\"FORMAT#MP4#240p\"\n\"CHUNK#MP4#480P#1\"\n\nlength: number\ncategoryId: UUID\ncontentType: ContentType (MOVIE, SERIES, PODCAST)\n\ntype: VideoMetadataType (CHUNK, FORMAT, VIDEO)\nfileUrl: string\nstatus: VideoStatus (IN_PROGRESS, COMPLETED, DELETED)\ntitle: string\n\ncreatedAt: timestamp\nupdatedAt: timestamp\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qAO9NMdr6vRhydFXwWKnb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5024.291168148451,
      "y": 17185.45622558904,
      "width": 807.0835256946648,
      "height": 1935,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1843087202,
      "version": 1127,
      "versionNonce": 1274025186,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742403720151,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API Design\n\n1. GET /api/v1/search?filters={ type:\nuserSearch, category, contentType, keyword,\n}&page=1&limit=20&sortBy=timestamp\n\nResponse ->\n{\n    \"data\": [{\n        \"id\": \"\"\n        \"type\": \"movie\",\n        \"duration\": \n        \"category\": \"thriller\",\n    }],\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"limit\": 20\n}\n\n2. GET /v1/stream/\n{movieId}?page=1&limit=10&resolution=&forma\nt=&\n\n{\n    \"chunks\": [{\n        \"chunkId\": \"\",\n        \"fileUrl\": \"https://cdn....///\",\n        \"sizeMB\": 100\n    }]\n}\n\n3. GET /api/v1/search?type=homepage\n\nResponse ->\n\n{\n    \"recommendations\": [{\n        \"\"\n    }],\n    \"trending\": [{\n        \"contentType\": \"movie\",\n        \"category\": \"thriller\"\n    }],\n}",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API Design\n\n1. GET /api/v1/search?filters={ type: userSearch, category, contentType, keyword,  }&page=1&limit=20&sortBy=timestamp\n\nResponse ->\n{\n    \"data\": [{\n        \"id\": \"\"\n        \"type\": \"movie\",\n        \"duration\": \n        \"category\": \"thriller\",\n    }],\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"limit\": 20\n}\n\n2. GET /v1/stream/{movieId}?page=1&limit=10&resolution=&format=&\n\n{\n    \"chunks\": [{\n        \"chunkId\": \"\",\n        \"fileUrl\": \"https://cdn....///\",\n        \"sizeMB\": 100\n    }]\n}\n\n3. GET /api/v1/search?type=homepage\n\nResponse ->\n\n{\n    \"recommendations\": [{\n        \"\"\n    }],\n    \"trending\": [{\n        \"contentType\": \"movie\",\n        \"category\": \"thriller\"\n    }],\n}",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
